 below shows all possible fish pond products, along with the required fish pond population for the item to be possible. The column \"% of Items\" provides each item's chance as a fraction of all items produced by the pond. The column \"Overall Daily Chance\" is the chance of the item appearing on a given day, obtained by multiplying the base chance (23-95%) by the \"% of Items\". Both chances may vary depending upon the fish pond population, as may the possible counts of a given item. More details on all item chances are provided on each individual fish page."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Fish"]},{"h":1,"v":["Item(s) Produced"]},{"h":1,"v":["Required Population"]},{"h":1,"v":["% of Items"]},{"h":1,"v":["Overall Daily Chance"]}],[{"r":3,"v":[["l","狮子鱼","Lionfish"]]},["1 ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"]],["1"],["71-100%"],["23-67%"]],[["2-5 ",["l","芋头块茎","Taro Tuber"]],["4"],["10-28%"],["20-26%"]],[["1 ",["l","史莱姆蛋","Tiger Slime Egg"]],["9"],["2%"],["1.7-1.9%"]],[{"r":3,"v":[["l","蓝铁饼鱼","Blue Discus"]]},["1 ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"]],["1"],["80-100%"],["23-76%"]],[["1 ",["l","香蕉","Banana"]],["4"],["7-16%"],["5-15%"]],[["1 ",["l","金色椰子","Golden Coconut"]],["9"],["5%"],["4%"]],[{"r":5,"v":[["l","黄貂鱼","Stingray"]]},["1 ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"]],["1"],["80-100%"],["18-77%"]],[["1 ",["l","熔岩菇","Magma Cap"]],["4"],["5%"],["2%"]],[["2-5 ",["l","火山晶石","Cinder Shard"]],["7"],["8-10%"],["7-9%"]],[["1 ",["l","龙牙","Dragon Tooth"]],["9"],["5%"],["5%"]],[["1 ",["l","电池组","Battery Pack"]],["9"],["10%"],["9-10%"]],[[["l","鱿鱼","Squid"]],["1 ",["l","鱿鱼墨汁","Squid Ink"]],["1"],["25-100%"],["6-95%"]],[[["l","午夜鱿鱼","Midnight Squid"]],["1-2 ",["l","鱿鱼墨汁","Squid Ink"]],["1"],["20-97%"],["5-92%"]],[[["l","鲤鱼","Carp"],"\n",["l","鲶鱼","Catfish"],"\n",["l","鲱鱼","Herring"]],["1 ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"]],["1"],["100%"],["23-95%"]],[{"r":2,"v":[["l","午夜鲤鱼","Midnight Carp"]]},["1 ",["l","鱼籽","Roe"]],["1"],["92-100%"],["23-87%"]],[["1 ",["l","河凝胶","River Jelly"]],["7"],["5-8%"],["4-7%"]],[{"r":2,"v":[["l","比目鱼","Flounder"]]},["1 ",["l","鱼籽"